      "solver_final_answer": "**Root Cause:**  \nThe root cause of the issue is the recent deployment (release `rel-2026-114`) to `inventory-db`, which introduced an unindexed `FOR UPDATE` query on the `stock_reservations` table. This caused severe lock contention and deadlocks, leading to lock timeouts and degraded performance. The PostgreSQL error code `PG_LOCK_TIMEOUT_55P03` and `PG_DEADLOCK_40P01` confirm the lock-related issues.\n\n**Offending Release:**  \n`rel-2026-114` - \"Migration 114: Add unindexed batch stock_reservations FOR UPDATE query\"\n\n**PostgreSQL Error Code:**  \n- `PG_LOCK_TIMEOUT_55P03` (Lock timeout)\n- `PG_DEADLOCK_40P01` (Deadlock detected)\n\n**Rollback Command:**  \n`pg_migrate rollback --target inventory-db --to rel-2026-113`",
